WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.591
Hey I'm Nat, I run an online health and
fitness coaching business managing quite a

00:00:05.591 --> 00:00:06.000
bit of

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
client info so keeping that data safe is
really important to me.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.691
Before working with Andy and the team,
security was always in the back of my

00:00:16.691 --> 00:00:17.000
mind.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.512
I'd hear about companies getting hacked
and it was definitely worrying and yeah

00:00:22.512 --> 00:00:23.000
one day

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.000
I decided to do something about it and I
chose Andy

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
and the team because I could see they took
security seriously. They even tried

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
to break into our systems themselves
looking for weaknesses like a real

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
attacker would and they found a security
hole, fixed it and put monitoring in

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.000
place to keep an eye on things moving
forward.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.000
So yeah, this gives me great peace of mind
knowing a team that

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
understands this stuff is taking care of
us. If you're a business handling

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
customer data, get in touch with Andy and
the team.
